 &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;We ship ALL in-stock orders on the same day or the next business day after cleared payment received. We do not ship on weekends or holidays.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;US and CANADA only.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;For other international locations please contact us to get a shipping quote.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;When your shipment is confirmed, you will receive a shipment confirmation e-mail.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Domestic Orders: Items will be shipped via USPS First Class Mail or Parcel Post Transit time is approximately 2-7 business days.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;International Orders: Items will be shipped via USPS First Class International Mail, Transit time is approximately 7-25 business days.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;div class="box"&gt; &lt;div class="title"&gt; &lt;i class="fa fa-refresh"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Returns &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;All returns must be pre-approved by Emailing to our RMA Department (Return Merchandise Authorization). To accomplish this, please provide the buyer?s Ebay ID, item number and a description of the issue. Not providing the detailed information requested will delay the returns process. Shipment fee is not refundable for international orders.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Please use "Contact Seller" link in your account or click &lt;a href="" target="_blank"&gt;Contact us&lt;/a&gt; link to send us an email.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Once your request has been received, you will be contacted within 5 business days with an instruction for sending back the item(s). Please write the RMA number on the outside of the box.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;We will ship the replacement once we have received and processed the returned item(s). If you request for a refund, we will notify you via Email of your refund once we have received and processed the returned item(s).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Customers are responsible for determining their products compatibility with what we have for sale. We provide a general compatibility list, but please make sure that it will actually be compatible with your product. If purchasing a case, pouch, holster, clip please be aware that if you have an extended battery that it will most likely not fit. Pictures are for a general reference only. The item you get may differ from the one shown. The colors may be different as well as every computer displays colors differently.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;div class="box"&gt; &lt;div class="title"&gt; &lt;i class="fa fa-star-o"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Feedback &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Your satisfaction is important to us. If you have questions regarding your order, or if you feel that you have a problem with your order, please contact us for a resolution before leaving feedback and we will resolve the issue to your satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;We will automatically leave you a positive feedback once the payment is received.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class="footer"&gt;Thank you for your business.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/tbody&gt; &lt;/table&gt;</Description><ListingDuration>GTC</ListingDuration><ListingType>FixedPriceItem</ListingType><Location>06473</Location><PrimaryCategory><CategoryID>123422</CategoryID></PrimaryCategory><ProductListingDetails><BrandMPN><Brand>ODEMobile</Brand><MPN>S2FTB4-GI</MPN></BrandMPN></ProductListingDetails><ShippingDetails><ShippingServiceOptions><ShippingService>ShippingMethodStandard</ShippingService><ShippingServiceCost currencyID="USD">0.0</ShippingServiceCost><ShippingServiceAdditionalCost currencyID="USD">0.0</ShippingServiceAdditionalCost><ShippingServicePriority>1</ShippingServicePriority><FreeShipping>true</FreeShipping></ShippingServiceOptions><ShippingT